{"about_the_game":"<strong>Ready to go Pro?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/966720/extras/d493f8e5104dd3a502a42c4b0969277c.poster.avif?t=1747737323\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/966720/extras/d493f8e5104dd3a502a42c4b0969277c.webm?t=1747737323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/966720/extras/d493f8e5104dd3a502a42c4b0969277c.mp4?t=1747737323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pumped BMX Pro puts you back on the seat for another high adrenaline, fast-paced trickathon where chaining massive combos could put you at the number one spot on the global leaderboards. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/966720/extras/06f5203ca6821dcc227d74a4b06f8bfc.poster.avif?t=1747737323\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/966720/extras/06f5203ca6821dcc227d74a4b06f8bfc.webm?t=1747737323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/966720/extras/06f5203ca6821dcc227d74a4b06f8bfc.mp4?t=1747737323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pump your way through 60 levels of ever increasing difficulty, making sure you\u2019re racking up those platinum medals by completing Trick Challenges along the way. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/966720/extras/f96ee5444fe54088bb59afc8cc6805b8.poster.avif?t=1747737323\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset